    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/6e8c5bbac85655a64668c22595ca480d.poster.avif?t=1755310767\" width=670 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/6e8c5bbac85655a64668c22595ca480d.webm?t=1755310767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/6e8c5bbac85655a64668c22595ca480d.mp4?t=1755310767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In Drug Dealer 2049, you play as a drug dealer trying to build an empire in a dangerous futuristic city.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2D RPG mixes management, combat, and underground trading. Explore the streets, fight rival dealers, steal their drugs, and sell them using encrypted apps, always watching your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft or Steal</strong>: Manufacture your own drugs or kill competitors to loot their supply.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire:\u00a0</strong>Recruit dealers to sell for you and grow your empire without getting your hands dirty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Criminal RPG</strong>: Fight rival dealers, make tough choices, build your reputation and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encrypted Trade App</strong>:\u00a0 Sell your product via a futuristic in-game messaging system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tech Tree &amp; Upgrades</strong>: Unlock tools, expand operations, and evolve your empire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/c8de25379a366563211eb7511e104414.poster.avif?t=1755310767\" width=780 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/c8de25379a366563211eb7511e104414.webm?t=1755310767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/c8de25379a366563211eb7511e104414.mp4?t=1755310767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/6e8c5bbac85655a64668c22595ca480d.poster.avif?t=1755310767\" width=670 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/6e8c5bbac85655a64668c22595ca480d.webm?t=1755310767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/6e8c5bbac85655a64668c22595ca480d.mp4?t=1755310767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In Drug Dealer 2049, you play as a drug dealer trying to build an empire in a dangerous futuristic city.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2D RPG mixes management, combat, and underground trading. Explore the streets, fight rival dealers, steal their drugs, and sell them using encrypted apps, always watching your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft or Steal</strong>: Manufacture your own drugs or kill competitors to loot their supply.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire:\u00a0</strong>Recruit dealers to sell for you and grow your empire without getting your hands dirty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Criminal RPG</strong>: Fight rival dealers, make tough choices, build your reputation and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encrypted Trade App</strong>:\u00a0 Sell your product via a futuristic in-game messaging system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tech Tree &amp; Upgrades</strong>: Unlock tools, expand operations, and evolve your empire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/c8de25379a366563211eb7511e104414.poster.avif?t=1755310767\" width=780 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/c8de25379a366563211eb7511e104414.webm?t=1755310767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576240/extras/c8de25379a366563211eb7511e104414.mp4?t=1755310767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
